  "description": "meme-id: monkey_blood; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a dead monkey with visible blood, juxtaposed with the text 'monkey blood'. This visual and textual combination is intended to evoke a visceral, disturbing reaction. The meme's overall intent is hateful, as it uses the image of a suffering or dead animal to reinforce dehumanizing and derogatory stereotypes that associate Black people with primates. This is a direct and indirect attack on a protected characteristic (race), invoking a long-standing and harmful racist trope. The graphic nature of the image and the explicit text serve to amplify the offensive message, making it a hateful meme that perpetuates racial prejudice and violence against Black individuals by equating them with animals.",
